g a game.","Find a spare ruler before drawing a chart.","Find out which door a collector actually means.","Frogs catch insects away from water.","Give a beginning player a cue for their own part.","Give growing seedlings room between their leaves.","Hang bags on hooks to leave reading seats free.","How actors learn to play their characters.","How builders design a new model before starting.","How bus drivers learn a new route.","How deep sides and straps hold picnic things securely.","How drivers pack parcels into a delivery van.","How helpers answer questions about lessons and clubs.","How helpers clean and sort materials for building.","How learners choose songs for a concert.","How lunchbox parts separate food and keep it inside.","How maps and helpers answer different visitors’ questions.","How signs and staff help travellers find their trains.","How teachers design a new sports class.","How the office records and returns lost objects.","How tickets guide families to their rows and seats.","How to choose clothes for a rainy day.","How to choose fruit for a healthy lunch.","How to choose games for the playground.","How to choose recipes for a cooking lesson.","How to make a backpack from cloth.","How to repair the torn pages in a book.","How to wash bottles before filling them.","How visitors choose what time to arrive.","How volunteers gather books and help visitors choose.","How walkers choose comfortable new shoes.","How workers build a new train platform.","How writers choose names for their books.","Identify one recorded familiar word.","Include strip lengths as well as how many to cut.","Include the day as well as the picnic time.","Keep a trumpet opening clear of a decorative bow.","Keep clean paper pieces for another group to use.","Keep loose map pages sheltered from the wind.","Keep paper shop signs sheltered from the rain.","Keep the magnifier on its labelled shelf.","Keep wet paintings apart while they are drying.","Keep wrapping paper away from a car